    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d130">

                <pb facs="0218" n="952" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg952"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Baron
                            Fava.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Personal.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-23"><hi rendition="#italic">October 23,
                        1895</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Baron Fava</hi>:</p>
                <p>I have received your personal note, undated, filed in this Department on the 18th
                    instant, relative to the indigent condition of the families of the Italians
                    lynched in Colorado, and beg to say in reply that the matter has been referred
                    to the governor of Colorado for his consideration.</p>
                <p>Very sincerely, yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwin F. Uhl.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
